{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方員任器，頭角全彰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "體用互收，名言不立"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隱顯無私，傍通這畔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兼偏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "縱也，明其事也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奪也，辨其理也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先縱後奪，以事明理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先奪後縱，以理辨其事。以有為無，喚事作\n理，非無作有，以理作事，事理非事，以此作用，立明其道。非理非事，如開拳成掌，握掌成拳，但了是手，拳掌\n俱是，而亦俱非，直得纖毫不立。所以道：掀翻大海魚龍隱，踢倒須彌日月昏。縱以理為空下，總計其四也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X65n1282_p0270d15"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T47n1998Ap0834c13"}
{"id": null, "n": "0747002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0747002", "type": "mod", "text": "誤【CB】，悟【卍續】，悟疑誤"}
{"id": null, "n": "0749003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0749003", "type": "mod", "text": "縱【CB】，蹤【卍續】，蹤疑縱下同"}
